*.xls
*.xlsm
*.pdf
*.count.txt
*.fingerprint.txt
*.windows.txt
*.detailcheck.txt
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
out/
output/
*_out/

# 以后若把合成夹具放进 tests/，不要被上面的图纸规则挡住。当前测试在临时目录生成 DXF，仓库里没有这些文件。
!dwg-quantity-takeoff/tests/**/*.dxf
!dwg-quantity-takeoff/tests/**/*.json
!dwg-quantity-takeoff/tests/**/*.csv
!dwg-quantity-takeoff/tests/**/*.png

